⚡🇺🇦🇷🇴🇧🇬A Ukrainian MAYA decoy drone entered Bulgaria from Romania and crashed this morning in Kardam, near the border and less than 1 km from the Trans-Balkan gas pipeline. No injuries or damage are reported. 

The Bulgarian government confirms that the aircraft was not detected by Romanian and Bulgarian radar. The Bulgarian Ministry of Defense rules out an intentional act.

